301
00:16:59,879 --> 00:17:03,120
and you would say you wanted my stir-fried rice noodles.

302
00:17:03,799 --> 00:17:04,960
It's a coincidence today.

303
00:17:06,079 --> 00:17:08,519
I made stir-fried rice noodles and you won an award.

304
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:10,440
The Best Senior.

305
00:17:11,759 --> 00:17:12,480
Eat.

306
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:22,400
About the thing last night,

307
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:24,119
I talked to Director Qian on the phone.

308
00:17:24,519 --> 00:17:25,640
He told me

309
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,519
the whole story.

310
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:30,079
It was indeed

311
00:17:31,079 --> 00:17:32,000
a misunderstanding.

312
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:37,880
Eat it while it's hot.

313
00:17:50,799 --> 00:17:52,640
But anyway,

314
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:55,160
he shouldn't have hit you.

315
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:58,319
Be careful in the future.

316
00:17:59,160 --> 00:17:59,920
Do you think

317
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:02,079
I'm too strict with you?

318
00:18:05,519 --> 00:18:06,400
Honestly,

319
00:18:19,599 --> 00:18:20,440
we don't

320
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:22,200
have many chances

321
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,440
to talk like this.

322
00:18:23,799 --> 00:18:25,039
You can

323
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:28,200
say whatever you want.

324
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,160
What did you ever care about?

325
00:18:48,079 --> 00:18:48,839
Yeah,

326
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,240
I'm too busy

327
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,480
with business,

328
00:18:54,799 --> 00:18:58,319
and sometimes I don't care about you enough.

329
00:18:59,359 --> 00:19:00,640
But Haoyu,

330
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,960
you should

331
00:19:07,039 --> 00:19:09,319
understand me.

332
00:19:12,599 --> 00:19:14,240
Li Haoyu,

333
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,519
you can't say

334
00:19:15,519 --> 00:19:18,279
I don't care about you at all.

335
00:19:19,799 --> 00:19:21,079
Are you

336
00:19:21,079 --> 00:19:23,000
saying that to me?

337
00:19:23,559 --> 00:19:24,640
Do you think

338
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:25,799
I don't care about you?

339
00:19:30,559 --> 00:19:31,240
You...

340
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,400
You may have cared about me.

341
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:36,319
I heard you had a nickname

342
00:19:36,319 --> 00:19:37,119
at school,

343
00:19:37,119 --> 00:19:39,240
Troublemaker-in-Chief.

344
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:42,279
You're like this even when I do care about you.

345
00:19:42,279 --> 00:19:43,680
If I don't care about you,

346
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,480
what would you be like?

347
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:51,640
If you have a child in the future,

348
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,359
will you talk to him?

349
00:19:53,759 --> 00:19:55,119
Will you educate him?

350
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:58,400
If I say a few words,

351
00:19:59,079 --> 00:20:01,480
you'd say I'm too preachy.

352
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,960
If I'm not paternalistic,

353
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:04,119
what should I be?

354
00:20:04,759 --> 00:20:06,599
If I'm not paternalistic, am I still your father?

355
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,400
Alright.

356
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,519
Dad, don't talk so much.

357
00:20:12,279 --> 00:20:13,480
Eat while it's hot.

358
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:13,839
No.

359
00:20:13,839 --> 00:20:14,640
Can you understand

360
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:16,359
what I'm saying?

361
00:20:19,039 --> 00:20:19,880
A little bit.

362
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,200
Okay.

363
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,759
I'll be happy if you can.

364
00:20:22,759 --> 00:20:23,599
I'm easy to please.

365
00:20:27,759 --> 00:20:28,480
Eat.

366
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,240
It's too salty.

367
00:20:44,599 --> 00:20:45,960
Do you think it's too salty?

368
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:47,920
I think it's fine.

369
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:53,720
Stop eating.

370
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:55,440
I'll make you another one.

371
00:20:55,599 --> 00:20:56,039
It's okay.

372
00:20:56,039 --> 00:20:56,359
I'll just

373
00:20:56,359 --> 00:20:57,000
make you another one.

374
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:57,400
It's too salty.

375
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,640
Give it to me, Dad.

376
00:20:58,640 --> 00:20:59,759
I just like this bowl.

377
00:21:19,039 --> 00:21:20,240
Didn't you say it was too salty?

378
00:21:21,599 --> 00:21:22,880
Didn't you say it wasn't salty?

379
00:22:04,599 --> 00:22:06,559
Li Haoyu has made significant progress this semester.

380
00:22:07,119 --> 00:22:09,000
He's no longer at the bottom of his grade.

381
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,680
Thanks to his teammates

382
00:22:10,680 --> 00:22:11,480
for helping him with his lessons.

383
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,680
The basketball team is also doing well.

384
00:22:15,319 --> 00:22:16,599
They just formed a team,

385
00:22:16,599 --> 00:22:17,599
and they won the game

386
00:22:17,599 --> 00:22:18,559
against last year's runner-up,

387
00:22:18,559 --> 00:22:19,640
Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education.

388
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,519
I have many photos.

389
00:22:21,519 --> 00:22:22,599
I'll send them to you.

390
00:22:24,359 --> 00:22:24,920
By the way,

391
00:22:25,559 --> 00:22:26,680
at the Arts Festival,

392
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,039
their stage play

393
00:22:28,039 --> 00:22:29,000
won first place.

394
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:30,440
Li Haoyu was the lead,

395
00:22:31,319 --> 00:22:33,160
and he also led a band.

396
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,720
It was a great honor for the school.

397
00:22:38,279 --> 00:22:39,240
Director Qian,

398
00:22:39,599 --> 00:22:41,000
I've been busy

399
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,119
with business these years.

400
00:22:42,839 --> 00:22:44,440
I thought boys

401
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:45,839
could be raised freely.

402
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,599
Now I see

403
00:22:49,319 --> 00:22:50,759
I haven't been

404
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:53,680
a good father.

405
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,519
It's not too late

406
00:22:55,839 --> 00:22:57,440
to be a good father

407
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,880
from now on.

408
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:29,400
Why didn't Fu Binyan like my post?
